1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:01,699
Mistaking a dog breed

2
00:00:01,699 --> 00:00:03,400
with AI is harmless,

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,455
but a false positive

4
00:00:04,455 --> 00:00:05,770
on a toxic mushroom

5
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:06,960
can be fatal.

6
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,349
The reason computer vision

7
00:00:08,349 --> 00:00:09,565
fails so badly

8
00:00:09,565 --> 00:00:10,670
is a physical trap

9
00:00:10,670 --> 00:00:12,239
called visual occlusion.

10
00:00:12,239 --> 00:00:13,429
Take the death cap,

11
00:00:13,429 --> 00:00:14,904
a highly toxic mushroom

12
00:00:14,904 --> 00:00:16,341
AI frequently mistakes

13
00:00:16,341 --> 00:00:17,900
for a harmless edible.

14
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,000
AI relies strictly

15
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,429
on surface pixels.

16
00:00:20,429 --> 00:00:21,256
From a top-down

17
00:00:21,256 --> 00:00:22,364
smartphone photo,

18
00:00:22,364 --> 00:00:23,306
the death cap's shape

19
00:00:23,306 --> 00:00:25,011
looks perfectly innocent.

20
00:00:25,011 --> 00:00:26,091
But human experts

21
00:00:26,091 --> 00:00:27,405
don't just look at the cap.

22
00:00:27,405 --> 00:00:27,990
To spot this

23
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:29,170
specific threat,

24
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:29,973
they check for a

25
00:00:29,973 --> 00:00:30,856
sack-like structure

26
00:00:30,856 --> 00:00:32,244
at the base of the stem.

27
00:00:32,244 --> 00:00:33,529
But out in the wild,

28
00:00:33,529 --> 00:00:34,354
this crucial root

29
00:00:34,354 --> 00:00:35,503
is completely buried

30
00:00:35,503 --> 00:00:37,374
under soil and fallen leaves.

31
00:00:37,374 --> 00:00:38,169
Because it's blocked

32
00:00:38,169 --> 00:00:39,764
from the camera's line of sight

33
00:00:39,764 --> 00:00:41,209
that's visual occlusion

34
00:00:41,209 --> 00:00:42,920
the data doesn't exist.

35
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:44,035
And this limitation

36
00:00:44,035 --> 00:00:45,429
goes deeper than the dirt.

37
00:00:45,429 --> 00:00:46,269
Flipping the cap

38
00:00:46,269 --> 00:00:47,859
reveals pure white gills,

39
00:00:47,859 --> 00:00:49,584
which drop a white spore print,

40
00:00:49,584 --> 00:00:51,208
a classic warning sign.

41
00:00:51,208 --> 00:00:52,743
A 2D surface image

42
00:00:52,743 --> 00:00:53,562
can never capture

43
00:00:53,562 --> 00:00:54,665
what's underneath.

44
00:00:54,665 --> 00:00:56,160
Because AI can't infer

45
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:57,610
features it can't see,

46
00:00:57,610 --> 00:00:59,085
it makes life-or-death guesses

47
00:00:59,085 --> 00:01:00,973
using deceptive camouflage.

48
00:01:00,973 --> 00:01:02,458
And that deadly death cap,

49
00:01:02,458 --> 00:01:03,540
missing the buried root

50
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:04,933
and hidden white gills,

51
00:01:04,933 --> 00:01:06,645
the AI confidently labels

52
00:01:06,645 --> 00:01:08,031
the lethal hazard:

53
00:01:08,031 --> 00:01:11,000
safe to eat.

